        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 73.5,
          "end": 74.67,
          "en": "that should be imported.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.67,
          "end": 78.33,
          "en": "And here in my case, that's this increment action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 78.33,
          "end": 83.223,
          "en": "Hence, I'll import increment from my counterActions file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 84.06,
          "end": 87.483,
          "en": "And then, you must execute this like a function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 88.65,
          "end": 92.88,
          "en": "So in the end, the thing that is returned by createAction,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 92.88,
          "end": 95.34,
          "en": "is a function increment here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 95.34,
          "end": 97.92,
          "en": "The increment we're exporting in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 97.92,
          "end": 101.28,
          "en": "under the hood is a function that can be executed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 101.28,
          "end": 104.43299999999999,
          "en": "And it must be executed when dispatching.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 105.72,
          "end": 110.61,
          "en": "It's not executed when adding adhere to on in the Reducer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 110.61,
          "end": 113.31,
          "en": "There we instead just point at it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 113.31,
          "end": 116.10300000000001,
          "en": "but it is executed when we dispatch.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 116.94,
          "end": 119.72999999999999,
          "en": "And that's how such an action can be dispatched.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 119.72999999999999,
          "end": 122.37,
          "en": "So in the end, you define an action,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 122.37,
          "end": 124.32,
          "en": "you can dispatch it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 124.32,
          "end": 127.5,
          "en": "and you listen to it and define what should happen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 127.5,
          "end": 130.233,
          "en": "to the state when that action occurs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 131.28,
          "end": 133.59,
          "en": "You can also add data to actions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 133.59,
          "end": 135.69,
          "en": "but I'll get back to this in a second.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 135.69,
          "end": 138.66,
          "en": "For the moment, let's just save it like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 138.66,
          "end": 141.42000000000002,
          "en": "And now, if I run NG serve again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 141.42000000000002,
          "end": 144.12,
          "en": "you see that if I reload and I click increment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 144.12,
          "end": 146.97,
          "en": "indeed, this counter changes here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 146.97,
          "end": 148.5,
          "en": "And it changes automatically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 148.5,
          "end": 150.9,
          "en": "because we're listening to this observable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 150.9,
          "end": 152.57999999999998,
          "en": "with help of the async pipe.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 152.57999999999998,
          "end": 154.47,
          "en": "And that pipe got some work to do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 154.47,
          "end": 157.56,
          "en": "because we of course, are dispatching this action,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 157.56,
          "end": 161.163,
          "en": "which is changing the counter with help of the Reducer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 162,
          "end": 163.95,
          "en": "And the code is exactly the same,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 163.95,
          "end": 166.59,
          "en": "no matter if you're in a Standalone Component app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 166.59,
          "end": 169.32,
          "en": "or in an app that uses NG modules.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 169.32,
          "end": 173.85,
          "en": "Either way, you can copy and paste your Reducer code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 173.85,
          "end": 176.223,
          "en": "into this counter reducer file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 177.27,
          "end": 182.27,
          "en": "Copy the counter actions TS file into the store folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 182.79,
          "end": 185.58,
          "en": "Delete this counter service.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 185.58,
          "end": 188.34,
          "en": "And in the Counter-control Component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 188.34,
          "end": 192.15,
          "en": "you therefore inject the store,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 192.15,
          "end": 194.253,
          "en": "also here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 195.57,
          "end": 197.13,
          "en": "like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 197.13,
          "end": 198.48,
          "en": "And you just have to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 198.48,
          "end": 200.82,
          "en": "that store is imported from NgRx",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 200.82,
          "end": 203.07,
          "en": "and increment this increment action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
